  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Five friendly letters",
   "texto": [
    "These five have a familiar sound in their basic pronunciation: **А** (a), **К** (k), **М** (m), **О** (or when it carries the accent) and **Т** (t). Without an accent, **О** is usually reduced and sound like «a».",
    "With them you can already read **мама** (mom), **кот** (cat), **там** (there) and **как** (how)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Seven false friends",
   "texto": [
    "These look like our letters, but they sound different. They're the trap of the first few days.",
    "**В** sounds **v**. **Н** sounds **n**. **Р** sounds **r**. **С** sounds **s**. **У** sounds **u**. **Х** sounds like the Spanish **jota**.",
    "**Е** at the beginning of the word usually sounds «ye»; after a consonant, it softens it. That's why **нет** is approaching «net», not «niet»."
   ]
  },
